      "message": "test(motion): move the slow neck and island trochoid tests to the heavy lane\n\nEach test of slice C ran alone in debug. The neck test (168 s) and the\nisland pocket test (154 s) are over the 60 s limit. They move to the\nheavy lane with all their cases, and each gets a _light twin with one\ncase in the same file. The ring (50 s) and corner clean-up (29 s) tests\nstay in the default suite.\n\nRefs #3514\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
